><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"063b60d9acc5d2bd\" href=\"?note=063b60d9acc5d2bd\" title=\"20-df-d-simple\">20-df-d-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}d\\text{-}simple\\text{-}implies\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}d\\text{-}simple\\text{-}implies\\text{-}simple}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 d-simple 定义中取 X=∅，则 Y=∅；第二条件说明每个无限 c.e. Z 都与 A 相交，配合余无限性即为简单性。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare (1980), Proposition 1.2, p.138</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-d-simple","status":"resolved","id":"063b60d9acc5d2bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-d-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-d-simple","status":"resolved","id":"063b60d9acc5d2bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-d-simple]]；see [[20-df-simple]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id"